# The vectors a reader fails when this rule is deleted, and no others:
# a float read refuses NaN and the infinities.
#
# CMakeLists.txt builds that reader, and ctest requires its failures to be
# exactly this list. A vector added to the corpus that pins the rule belongs here.

float-refuse-positive-infinity
float-refuse-negative-infinity
float-refuse-quiet-nan
float-refuse-negative-quiet-nan
float-refuse-signaling-nan
float-refuse-nan-with-payload
float-refuse-negative-nan-all-payload-bits
float-refuse-nan-all-payload-bits
